<title>FRANCE: Alcatel-CIT to shed 1,200 jobs.</title>
<headline>Alcatel-CIT to shed 1,200 jobs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel-CIT, a French unit of Alcatel-Alsthom, will announce a social plan for 1,206 job losses for 1997 and 1998 to a central works council meeting on April 2, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>The cuts, out of a total of 9,400 staff, are part of an ongoing reorganisation and financial provisions have long been taken, he added.</p>
